<title>CHILE: Chile's Endesa H1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Chile's Endesa H1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Power generator Empresa Nacional de Electricidad SA, Endesa, reported the following results in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>				H1 1997	    H1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit		    71.40		92.16</p>
<p>Operating profit	    79.12	     111.87</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	10.62		 5.22</p>
<p>Total revenues	     263.24	     255.02</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>(( --Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
